{"article":{"id":1260803965530,"url":"https://twilio.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/1260803965530.json","html_url":"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260803965530-Pricing-and-Fees-for-A2P-10DLC-Service","author_id":360058123487,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":0,"vote_sum":1,"vote_count":41,"section_id":1260801859230,"created_at":"2021-04-05T16:58:30Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T14:09:49Z","name":"Pricing and Fees for A2P 10DLC Service","title":"Pricing and Fees for A2P 10DLC Service","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2026-06-15T14:09:49Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":1918714,"content_tag_ids":[],"label_names":["Messaging","A2P 10DLC","legacy console"],"body":"<h2 id=\"h_01JVQK4FCMBREKV7BG7ZXS1ZJ2\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Overview</span></h2><h4 id=\"h_01KTW0DM19HA3XE25HQVFDCM54\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>New Fees implemented August 1, 2025 </strong></span></h4><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">TCR increased some of their standard fees on August 1, 2025. Here’s a quick look:</span></p><div>\n<figure class=\"wysiwyg-table wysiwyg-table-align-left\" style=\"width: 87.43%;\"><table class=\"wysiwyg-table-resized\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 27%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 30%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 43%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Fee Type</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Previous</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Current</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Brand Registration</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$4.00</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$4.50</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Standard Vetting</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$40.00 (per vetting)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$41.50</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Vetting Appeal</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$10.00</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$11.00</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Authentication Plus</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$0.00</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$12.50 per retry (for eligible brands)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure><p> </p>\n</div><p class=\"notification\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Note: </strong><em>The Authentication Plus fee applies only to public, for-profit brands. Previously, a fee was not charged during initial verification — starting August 1, it is charged each time the step needs to be retried due to an error or incorrect submission. Authentication Plus is not available for non-profit brands at this time.</em></span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">A2P 10DLC refers to a system in the United States that allows businesses to send Application-to-Person (A2P) type messaging via standard 10-digit long code (10DLC) phone numbers. This system is specific to long code messaging toward the United States, and does not affect </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/223182068-What-is-a-Messaging-Short-Code-\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">short codes</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> or </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/360038172934-Information-and-best-practices-for-using-Toll-Free-SMS-in-the-US-and-Canada\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Toll-Free numbers</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> sent to the US.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">For an overview of A2P 10DLC and answers to many common questions, see </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260800720410-What-is-A2P-10DLC-\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">What is A2P 10DLC?</span></a></p><p> </p><h2 id=\"h_01KSTC90EM41QRWQ5K7JPMRW07\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Environment</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">legacy Twilio Console</span></p><p> </p><h2 id=\"h_01JNE6YBA9KZN30CZFP5BNJD7D\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">What You Need To Know</span></h2><h4 id=\"01H67JG7A325A6TG72TNQXYV2C\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>A2P 10DLC Pricing Overview</strong> </span><a href=\"#01H67JG7A325A6TG72TNQXYV2C\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">🔗</span></a>\n</h4><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">There are two categories of fees associated with A2P 10DLC: <strong>registration fees</strong>, and per-message <strong>carrier fees</strong>. Both types of fees are charged by carriers as part of the A2P 10DLC system, and are passed through by Twilio to our customers with no added cost.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Registration fees are applied when registering your US A2P Brand and your A2P Use Case, the moment they are registered with TCR.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Carrier fees are charged by carriers for A2P 10DLC messages sent to users on their networks. These fees are applied in addition to Twilio’s standard </span><a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/sms/pricing/us\"><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">US Messaging pricing</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">. In general, the fees are applied for each outbound SMS segment or MMS message. T-Mobile (including Sprint) also applies fees to inbound SMS and MMS.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Please see below for a full breakdown of the fees associated with A2P 10DLC.</span><br><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> </span></p><h4 id=\"01H67JG7A3E632Y2TW1FYJ4V50\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Registration Fees</strong> </span><a href=\"#01H67JG7A3E632Y2TW1FYJ4V50\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">🔗</span></a>\n</h4><h4 id=\"01H8HPVHDMTPT7DZT3938ZSNXJ\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Brand Registration</span></h4><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9a24f606db303b40ea41cf53440de691\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>US A2P Sole Proprietor Brand registration fee:</strong> $4.50 one-time registration fee (no</span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/4403988619163-Secondary-Vetting-for-A2P-10DLC\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> </span><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">Secondary Vetting for A2P 10DLC</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">). </span>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e4b08d127c228b87833c8e95bc05524fd\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>US A2P Low Volume Standard Brand registration fee:</strong> $4.50 one-time registration fee (no</span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/4403988619163-Secondary-Vetting-for-A2P-10DLC\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> </span><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">Secondary Vetting for A2P 10DLC</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">).</span>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea6c4f2b13a907b9be7213d10b1990e97\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>US A2P Standard Brand registration fee:</strong> $46 one-time registration fee (includes </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/4403988619163-Secondary-Vetting-for-A2P-10DLC\"><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">Secondary Vetting for A2P 10DLC</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">).</span>\n</li>\n</ol><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6793ab6b41a5a88b9dc9e5836fb1172f\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Note: Brand creation fee is charged at the time of creation with TCR and your Brand may still be in an unverified state. To avoid additional charges follow </span><a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/docs/sms/a2p-10dlc/troubleshooting-a2p-brands\"><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">troubleshooting steps here</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> if your Brand is in an unverified state.</span><br><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> </span>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e23b2ac561cc31e0aabd3a179f7539eaf\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">If you’re an individual or small business without a Tax ID (EIN), please see</span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/9550596959643-New-Changes-to-A2P-10DLC-Starter-Brands-FAQ\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> </span><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">New Changes to Sole Proprietor Brands FAQ</span></span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> for more details on how to register.</span><ul>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\" data-list-item-id=\"e14778814bda38f9c069c854d3eb6e134\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> If you have a Tax ID (EIN) and low traffic requirement (less than 6,000 messages per day), Low Volume Standard Brands can be used for mixed messaging campaigns with multiple use cases, multiple numbers per campaign, and higher throughput than Sole Prop.</span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\" data-list-item-id=\"ebeb213ccbe774c5a84ec612849b44273\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">If you have a Tax ID (EIN) and higher traffic requirement (more than 6,000 messages per day), Standard Brands can be used for multiple use cases, multiple numbers per campaign, and higher throughput.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1ddedc82e556bbc8deb6f361ae469711\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">For a full overview of the different Brand registration offerings, see our</span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/4407882914971-Comparison-between-Starter-Low-Volume-Standard-and-Standard-registration-for-A2P-10DLC\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> </span><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Comparison between Sole Prop, Low Volume Standard, and Standard registration for A2P 10DLC</span></span><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">.</span></span></a><br><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> </span>\n</li>\n</ul><h4 id=\"01H8HPVX3VBRCR20P214QZSGVW\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Campaign Registration</span></h4><ol>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\" data-list-item-id=\"e44dd9559e5ba9ee0458018c194fdcb2d\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>US A2P Campaign use case registration fees:</strong> $15 vetting fee</span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color wysiwyg-list-bold\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\" data-list-item-id=\"e4b18cb7872b15393b65ae2234ee1b524\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>US A2P Recurring Monthly Campaign registration fees:</strong></span></li>\n</ol><div><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table wysiwyg-table-align-left\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><table class=\"wysiwyg-table-resized\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: NaN%;\">\n<col style=\"width: NaN%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Campaign use case type</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Cost**</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Sole Prop (Starter)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$2/month</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Standard (see </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260801844470-List-of-campaign-use-case-types-for-A2P-10DLC-registration\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Table 1 here</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">)</span>\n</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$10/month</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Low-volume* mixed use case</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$1.50/month</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Special: Charity / 501(c)(3) Nonprofit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$3/month</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Special: Emergency Services</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">$5/month</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure></div><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e0f3b38e2b71bf3e85a7edc1072ef0a92\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Low Volume Mixed use cases support up to 2,000 SMS segments and MMS per day toward T-Mobile (see </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260804800549-T-Mobile-daily-message-limits-for-long-code-messaging-with-A2P-10DLC\"><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">T-Mobile daily limits</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">), and are given a lower </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260803225669-Message-throughput-MPS-and-Trust-Scores-for-A2P-10DLC-in-the-US\"><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">message throughput (MPS)</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> than other use cases, regardless of Trust Score. </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\" data-list-item-id=\"ed127726303ef9a643808f9609cd78edd\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">The Campaign use case registration fee is billed at time of approval, then as a renewal fee for the same amount each month, unless the Campaign is deactivated/deleted.</span></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec018b8c2e615162c57869d112931a17f\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">For details about campaign use cases, see </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260801844470-List-of-Campaign-Types-and-Use-Case-Types-for-A2P-10DLC-registration\"><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">List of campaign use case types for A2P 10DLC registration</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">.</span>\n</li>\n</ul><p> </p><h4 id=\"01HHQSRPWXGGD088WP0R1TWJG1\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Brand Appeal Fees</strong> </span><a href=\"#01HHQSRPWXGGD088WP0R1TWJG1\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">🔗</span></a>\n</h4><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Fees for unverified brand and trust score appeals:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><img src=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/article_attachments/40287345397147\" width=\"624\" height=\"260\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">For fees related to correcting nonprofit or government verification status on a brand, please see: </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/4405850570267-Nonprofit-and-Government-Guide-to-A2P-10DLC-Text-Messaging#h_01FJEZGBV1AF6VXY602P52T9GB:~:text=Additional%20Fee%20Scenarios%20when%20Correcting%20Nonprofit/Government%20Verification\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Additional Fee Scenarios when Correcting Nonprofit/Government Verification</span></a></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">For more information about resubmitting brands, please see our product documentation on </span><a class=\"toclink\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" href=\"https://www.twilio.com/docs/sms/a2p-10dlc/troubleshooting-a2p-brands#2-resubmitting-standardlvs-brands\" title=\"2. Resubmitting Standard/LVS Brands\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Resubmitting Standard/LVS Brands.</span></a><br><br><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> </span></p><h4 id=\"01H67JG7A36ZFKGJBQ9Z0SBS7Q\">\n<span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>Carrier Fees</strong> </span><a href=\"#01H67JG7A36ZFKGJBQ9Z0SBS7Q\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><strong>🔗</strong></span></a>\n</h4><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">In addition to the Twilio fee for sending SMS traffic in the United States (US), all carriers in the US also charge a Carrier Fee.  While volume pricing can apply to the Twilio Fee, since this Carrier Fee is passed through from the carrier every message segment is charged the same fee.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Each carrier has their own fee; f</span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">or complete details, refer to the 'Long code' table under the 'Carrier fees' section in the </span><a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/en-us/sms/pricing/us\"><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Twilio’s pricing guide</span></span><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">.</span></span></a></p><p> </p><h2 id=\"h_01JNE70TXCRRH6JSQ9TMXP4MA3\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Frequently Asked Questions</span></h2><h3 id=\"01H67JG7A4T0NZ05JWW90WFY8S\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Where can I review charges I’ve incurred? </span></h3><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">You can review the charges incurred on your monthly invoice, the CSV supplement to the invoice, the </span><a href=\"https://console.twilio.com/us1/billing/usage/summary\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Billing Usage Summary page</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> in your Twilio Console, and via the </span><a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/docs/usage/api/usage-record\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Usage API</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">See </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/360025603913-Reading-your-Twilio-Invoice\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Reading your Twilio Invoice</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> for details on how to read your Twilio invoice. Your invoice will show you the aggregate usage per fee across all your subaccounts and throughout all days of the month. </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/360022561474-How-to-Read-the-Twilio-Invoice-CSV-Supplement\"><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">How to Read the </span><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">Twilio Invoice CSV Supplement</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> explains how to use the CSV supplement, which also provides a split of fees per subaccount. </span><a href=\"https://support.twilio.com/hc/en-us/articles/223135967-Review-your-Twilio-project-usage-and-metrics\"><span style=\"color: #096ECC;\">Review your Twilio project usage and metrics</span></a><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\"> explains how to use the Usage API or view the Usage page in the Twilio Console.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: hsl(0, 0%, 0%);\">Based on the type of Brand(s) and Campaign(s) registered, the exact name of the fees may differ on your invoice.</span></p>","user_segment_ids":[]}}